{
  "id": "757",
  "title": "Poor Sense of Direction",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-06",
  "synopsis": "Little Le and Paul are going somewhere. But are they getting anywhere?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/757/57730926448d63984121348d538956e5469a6a65.mp3?1575282981",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "路痴\n\n小乐：我们在这儿右转。\n保罗：好！\n小乐：呀，不对不对，应该是左转，我们掉头回去。\n保罗：好！\n小乐：呀，不对！刚才右转是对的，我们再掉头回去。\n保罗：小乐，你确定吗？我们来来回回转了半个小时，可还在原点。\n小乐：听我的，这次一定没错！\n保罗：好吧！\n小乐：保罗……\n保罗：是不是又错了？\n小乐：对不起，我是个路痴！我们迷路了！",
    "traditional": "路痴\n\n小樂：我們在這兒右轉。\n保羅：好！\n小樂：呀，不對不對，應該是左轉，我們掉頭回去。\n保羅：好！\n小樂：呀，不對！剛才右轉是對的，我們再掉頭回去。\n保羅：小樂，你確定嗎？我們來來回回轉了半個小時，可還在原點。\n小樂：聽我的，這次一定沒錯！\n保羅：好吧！\n小樂：保羅……\n保羅：是不是又錯了？\n小樂：對不起，我是個路痴！我們迷路了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Someone with a poor sense of direction"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：我们在这儿右转。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我們在這兒右轉。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ men zài zhè‘r yòu zhuǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: We are turning right here."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：呀，不对不对，应该是左转，我们掉头回去。",
      "traditional": "小樂：呀，不對不對，應該是左轉，我們掉頭回去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè ya bú duì bú duì yīng gāi shì zuǒ zhuǎn wǒ men diào tóu huí qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Ah, wrong wrong, we have to turn left, let’s turn around and go back."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：好！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：呀，不对！刚才右转是对的，我们再掉头回去。",
      "traditional": "小樂：呀，不對！剛才右轉是對的，我們再掉頭回去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè ya bú duì gāng cái yòu zhuǎn shì duì de wǒ men zài diào tóu huí qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Ah, wrong! Just now it was correct to turn right, let’s turn around and go back again."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：小乐，你确定吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：小樂，你確定嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiǎo lè nǐ què dìng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "我们来来回回转了半个小时，可还在原点。",
      "traditional": "我們來來回回轉了半個小時，可還在原點。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men lái lái huí huí zhuàn le bàn ge xiǎo shí kě hái zài yuán diǎn",
      "english": "Paul: Little Le, are you certain?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "We’ve been going back and forth for half an hour, but we’re still at our point of origin."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小乐：听我的，这次一定没错！",
      "traditional": "小樂：聽我的，這次一定沒錯！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tīng wǒ de zhè cì yí dìng méi cuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Listen to me, this time it’s definitely sure!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "保罗：好吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Ok then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "小乐：保罗……",
      "traditional": "小樂：保羅……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bǎo luó",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Paul..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "保罗：是不是又错了？",
      "traditional": "保羅：是不是又錯了？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì bú shì yòu cuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Is it wrong again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "小乐：对不起，我是个路痴！我们迷路了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：對不起，我是個路痴！我們迷路了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè duì bu qǐ wǒ shì ge lù chī wǒ men mí lù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I’m sorry, I have a poor sense of direction! We’re lost!"
    }
  ],
